    "diagnosis": "Dysplastic naevus",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Dermoscopic features. Atypical naevus dermoscopically showing asymmetry of colours and structures. The naevus was diagnosed as a moderately dysplastic compound naevus.",
    "source": "by courtesy of Dr Iris Zalaudek",
