    "title": "",
    "legend": "Dermoscopic features. Large atypical naevus in a fair skin type dermoscopically showing slight asymmetry due to a patchy light-brown network at the periphery and areas of erythema and hypopigmentation in the centre. Histologically it was diagnosed as a moderately dysplastic naevus.",
